{#
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  THE PHONE APP BAR — REFERENCE §7.2 · design/AppBar.dc.html · skill §3
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Two variants and no third (HIG: back + title + ONE action):

    root   a tab destination (Home, Discover, Nominate, Vote hub, Events, Awards
           index, Pulse). A 52px row — an empty 88px rail · the centred small title,
           invisible at rest · search and the avatar in the other 88px rail — then the
           large Playfair title, which is the page's <h1> on a phone. The two equal
           rails are what centre the title against the BAR rather than against
           whatever sits in the slots.
    child  a pushed screen (vote page, nominee, results, award detail). 56px:
           back · title + sub, both truncating · share. Left-aligned.

  ── ON SCROLL ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  `shell.js` sets `data-scrolled` on `.ag-shell` when `<main>.scrollTop > 8` — a
  threshold, never a scrub. The bar fills to `--ag-bar` with a hairline, the large title
  collapses (a grid track, so it stays in the accessibility tree) and the small title
  fades in over 200ms. Reduced motion: shell.css takes the transitions to nothing.

  ── THE AVATAR IS A SHEET, NOT A LINK ──────────────────────────────────────

  It opens Quick settings (`data-ag-quick`). There are no separate Aa or language
  buttons in the phone bar (REFERENCE §18.5) — they live in that sheet.

  ── THE FIRST-VISIT LANGUAGE PROMPT HANGS UNDER THE ROOT BAR ONLY ──────────

  And only when `lang_ask()` — the server's half of the condition: this visitor has not
  answered (no `ag_lang` cookie). GAPS §3.8: the prompt used to be included
  unconditionally while that gate was registered and read by nothing, so somebody who
  pressed "Keep English" was asked again on every page.

  Args (all optional but `title`): variant, title, sub, back, share, search, avatar.
  The sub must ADD information and never repeat the title (skill §3).
#}
{% set _root   = (variant|default('root')) != 'child' %}
{% set _search = search is defined ? search : _root %}
{% set _share  = share  is defined ? share  : not _root %}
{% set _avatar = avatar is defined ? avatar : _root %}
{% set _ini    = member_name ? (member_name|split(' ')|filter(w => w != '')|map(w => w|first)|join|upper|slice(0, 2)) : 'AG' %}

<div class="ag-appbar ag-appbar--{{ _root ? 'root' : 'child' }}" data-ag-appbar>
  <div class="ag-appbar__row">
    {% if _root %}
      <span class="ag-appbar__rail" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    {% else %}
      <a class="ag-appbar__icon" href="{{ back|default('/') }}" aria-label="{{ 'Back'|trans }}">
        <svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg>
      </a>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ag-appbar__mid">
      {% if _root %}
        {# The same words as the <h1> below, hidden from assistive technology so the title
           is read once; the h1 stays in the tree when it collapses. #}
        <span class="ag-appbar__small" aria-hidden="true">{{ title }}</span>
      {% else %}
        <span class="ag-appbar__t">{{ title }}</span>
        {% if sub is defined and sub %}<span class="ag-appbar__sub">{{ sub }}</span>{% endif %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ag-appbar__end">
      {% if _search %}
        <a class="ag-appbar__icon" href="/discover" aria-label="{{ 'Search Africa GATES'|trans }}">
          <svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m20 20-3.6-3.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
        </a>
      {% endif %}
      {% if _share %}
        <button type="button" class="ag-appbar__icon" data-ag-share aria-label="{{ 'Share'|trans }}"
                data-ag-copied="{{ 'Link copied'|trans }}">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v12"></path><path d="m7 8 5-5 5 5"></path><path d="M5 14v5a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5"></path></svg>
        </button>
      {% endif %}
      {% if _avatar %}
        <button type="button" class="ag-appbar__icon" data-ag-quick aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="ag-quick" aria-label="{{ 'Account, language and display'|trans }}">
          <span class="ag-appbar__av" aria-hidden="true">{{ _ini }}</span>
        </button>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {% if _root %}
    <div class="ag-appbar__large"><div><h1 class="ag-appbar__h1">{{ title }}</h1></div></div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% if _root and lang_ask() %}{% include 'partials/lang-prompt.twig' %}{% endif %}
